[node name="Instructions" type="Label" parent="UI/Panel/Margin/Content"]
text = "The orange target sweeps the 13 x 13 baked single-LOD region, but waits whenever queued or loading work is pending so slower browsers cannot outrun residency. Each boundary crossing still demonstrates nearest-first queueing, bounded threaded loads, the load-2/unload-3 hysteresis band, memory estimate, latency, churn, and frame-time observation. Pause to inspect state; Reset Target also resets cumulative metrics."
